      "boundElements": null,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "KNOWN CEILINGS — deliberate, see CONCERNS.md §3b\nGPS is self-reported and the quiz answers ship inside destinations.json → a determined cheater cannot be stopped by the app.\nThe staff code is client-side: it prevents mis-taps, not fraud.  Fraud flags are ADVISORY — they never block a backup or a voucher.\nThe real gate is a human handing over a paper voucher at the ticket counter. Every control points at that moment.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "el066",
      "originalText": "KNOWN CEILINGS — deliberate, see CONCERNS.md §3b\nGPS is self-reported and the quiz answers ship inside destinations.json → a determined cheater cannot be stopped by the app.\nThe staff code is client-side: it prevents mis-taps, not fraud.  Fraud flags are ADVISORY — they never block a backup or a voucher.\nThe real gate is a human handing over a paper voucher at the ticket counter. Every control points at that moment.",
